{"version":1,"content":"<p>【4 字 😂】印度數碼憑證機構 eMudhra 突然宣布，董事會已決議自願退出全球公開 SSL/TLS 伺服器憑證業務，官方更批評「社交媒體過度放大事件」。</p><p>有資安研究員指出，該機構近期因憑證管理疏失引發各大瀏覽器信任危機，極有可能遭主流瀏覽器根憑證計劃全面除名，如今選擇「主動離場」，總算比被除名來得體面。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:24:28.942392+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:04:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:19.578074+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:18:07.102309+00:00","content_hash":"ffeeb800bba4b00d3ecd574c1fe4f589d9551e38055611d8b42e1c645b88c4fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}